The DataFusion Mode A engine in this crate is adapted from the
examples/datafusion-rust layout on the IBM repository's `main` branch
(which pins datafusion / datafusion-substrait 54.1). The v0.1.1 tag's
copy of that example still pins DataFusion 35 and is not used as
source. No IBM SDK or example source is copied into this repository.
